    <briefdescription>
<para>A special ThreadPool that allows for spawning new tasks after blocking on wait(). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_balanced_partitioning" kindref="compound">BalancedPartitioning</ref> recursively spawns new threads inside other threads, so we need to track how many active threads that could spawn more threads. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
